////////////////////////////////////////
// greek and derivatives

// general guideline is to make greek distinguishable from
// latin with a presence of subtle serifs.
// also, prefer asymmetric corners if possible.

name-parts $gr-lex = alpha beta gamma delta epsilon zeta eta theta iota kappa lambda mu nu xi omicron pi rho sigma tau upsilon phi chi psi omega

